sequenceDiagram
    participant Frontend as StudyStore
    participant Backend as SessionsAPI

    Frontend->>Frontend: saveToStorage() — 写 localStorage
    Frontend->>Frontend: filter conversations with messages.length > 0

    loop 对每个 nonEmpty conversation
        Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/sessions/save
        Note right of Frontend: body = {conv_id, title, messages: [{role, content}]}
        Backend-->>Frontend: {status: "ok", conv_id: "..."}
    end
